  annotation "note_1771578503114_1", anchor: "whose brazier failed last", text: "Someone was counting. Someone watched the braziers extinguish in sequence and noted which held longest. The Chowei clutch survived longer than anyone else in their section — long enough to be observed, not long enough to be reached. I cannot find the name Chowei in any record before or after this event. They exist only as a duration.", type: :commentary, display: :popout
